<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against both the dollar and the pound on Wednesday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee firmed to a commercial mean rate of 20.1535 to a dollar from 20.1690 on Tuesday. The rupee traded at a mean of 32.548 against the pound from 32.558.</p>
</text>
